<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 1.08 BLN POLISH T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 1.08 BLN POLISH T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 1.08 billion zlotys, in nominal terms, of Polish T-bills against the finance ministry's 1.1 billion zloty offer, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
